{"id":"6d5d7c9d78e08590","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-expressible.md","title":"Expressible Set","display":"df-expressible — Expressible Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-expressible","aliases":["92-df-expressible"],"display":"df-expressible — Expressible Set","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-standard-model]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-substitution]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-expressible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-expressible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-expressible — Expressible Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-expressible-—-Expressible-Set-$E$\">df-expressible — Expressible Set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (capture-avoiding substitution, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> (standard arithmetic structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Express}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Express}_G\\)</span> (definition-target expressibility predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}expressible} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Express}_G(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl[n\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak N_G\\models_G\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}expressible} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Express}_G(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl[n\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak N_G\\models_G\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Express}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Express}(A)\\)</span> : 集合<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可表达</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)\\)</span>：把数码<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span>无捕获地代入唯一允许自由出现的变量位置</li>\n<li>可表达集合：存在公式能区分成员与非成员</li>\n<li>这是可表示性的基础概念</li>\n<li>Smullyan区分&quot;可表达&quot;(expressible)和&quot;可表示&quot;(representable)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-expressible-—-Expressible-Set-$E$","text":"df-expressible — Expressible Set $E$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-standard-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · dep